## Test hangs / locks

Hang, advisory lock wait, or resource leak → `TEST_EXECUTION_STOP` (contract N). Diagnose before rerunning. R3: harness clean before product work resumes.

## Scope expansion

Material product/architecture/security/payment/auth/market/data expansion:

```
SCOPE_EXPANSION_REQUIRED
```

## Evidence

Never invent evidence. Founder input: `EVIDENCE_SOURCE: founder_observation`.

## Parallelism

Only after `SCOPE_LOCKED`. Separate write scopes. Orchestrator integrates + runs shared verification.

## Stuck

Two failed attempts without verified progress → `ROOT_CAUSE_NOT_VERIFIED` → escalate or stop.

